%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"primaryColor":"#dbe9fb","primaryBorderColor":"#2563a8","actorBkg":"#dbe9fb","actorBorder":"#2563a8","noteBkgColor":"#fef3c7","fontFamily":"Helvetica","fontSize":"13px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SIM as fire-simulator
    participant BS as BuildSim
    participant SG as sensor-gateway
    participant MQ as mosquitto
    participant AG as building-agent
    participant AC as actuator-gateway
    participant DG as door-gateway
    participant OC as occupants
    Note over SIM: A109 smoulders (smoke, CO)
    SIM->>BS: PUT room layers (smoke rising)
    SG->>BS: GET room layers
    SG->>MQ: building/level0/A109/sensors
    MQ->>AG: reading (validated, features, detector)
    Note over AG: smoke ≥ 8 %/m → ALARM
    AG->>MQ: doors/egress/set unlocked, level0/doors/set closed
    MQ->>DG: door commands
    DG->>BS: PUT /api/doors (one snapshot)
    AG->>MQ: evacuation/plan v2 {evacuate, level0–2}
    MQ->>OC: plan
    OC->>BS: highlights, route, people walking out
    Note over SIM: flaming, rate of rise + CO
    MQ->>AG: hotter readings
    Note over AG: rate of rise with CO → SUPPRESSING
    AG->>MQ: A109/actuator/sprinkler/set on
    MQ->>AC: command
    AC->>BS: PUT actuator state on
    AC->>MQ: …/sprinkler/state on (confirmed)
    SIM->>BS: GET equipment (sprinkler on)
    Note over SIM: heat release decays exp(−t/43 s)
    Note over AG: cool and steady ≥ 300 s → COOLDOWN, 180 s later all_clear
    AG->>MQ: plan {all_clear}, doors normal
